    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just exhausting. waking up every morning to this... this emptiness. my body is failing me, my friends are gone, and honestly, it feels like the world has already moved on without me. i'm just a ghost in this house. what's the point of fighting it when the end is inevitable anyway?",
